wdi_indicators was downloaded directly from the World Bank website at https://databank.worldbank.org/source/world-development-indicators. 2006-2026 Data of the relevant variables (e.g. GDP per capita, total population, population using internet) were downloaded but only 2021 data were merged to the Eurobarometer dataset in the analysis. 
ZA7847_v1-0-0.dta was downloaded directly from the GESIS at https://search.gesis.org/research_data/ZA7847?doi=10.4232/1.14063. 
